0
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Scrolls
// The scroll items. Each scroll is an item that, when used, summons monsters.
//   Scroll: Number of the scroll. The next parts use it.
//   Item: Item that is the scroll.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~999]    [0~8191]
//  Scroll     Item
//----------------------------------------------------------
    0          7681
end

1
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Summoned Monsters
// The monsters each scroll can summon. In each group one monster is picked at random by its weight; every group of the scroll summons one (up to 20 groups, numbered 0 to 19).
//   Scroll: Number of the scroll.
//   Group: Group of monsters (0 to 19). One monster of each group is summoned.
//   Monster: Monster that can be summoned.
//   Weight: Chance of this monster inside its group, out of 10000. The weights of a group should add up to 10000.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~999]    [0~19]    [Number]    [0~10000]
//  Scroll     Group     Monster     Weight
//----------------------------------------------------------
    0          0         275         10000
end

//---------------------------------------------------------------------
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Messages
// The announcement sent to everyone when a group is summoned. The scroll can not be used on event maps or in safe zones.
//   Scroll: Number of the scroll.
//   Group: Group of monsters (0 to 19) the message is for.
//   Mention the player: 1 puts the name of the player who used the scroll first in the message. Then {0} is the player, {1} the monster and, if the map is on, {2} the map.
//   Mention the map: 1 puts the name of the map in the message as the last value. Without the player {0} is the monster and {1} the map; without both, only {0} the monster.
//   English: Message for English players.
//   Spanish: Message for Spanish players.
//   Portuguese: Message for Portuguese players.
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~999]    [0~19]    [Number]      [Number]    [Text]                                    [Text]                                    [Text]
//  Scroll     Group     ShowPlayer    ShowMap     English                                   Spanish                                   Portuguese
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2
    0          0         1             1           "{1} has been summoned by {0} in {2}!"    "{1} ha sido invocado por {0} en {2}!"    "{1} foi invocado por {0} em {2}!"
end